{"products":[{"id":9222134825123,"title":"The Bio-Active Ceramide Trio","handle":"the-bio-active-ceramide-trio","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat you get:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eThe complete Bio-Active Ceramide routine for face, eyes and neck. Three targeted formulas built around the same clinically active ceramide, each one dosed and textured for skin that behaves differently. Clinically proven to repair the skin barrier from first use**, lift eyelids by 29% in 4 weeks***, and visibly firm and smooth the neck in 14 days****.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy it works:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eMost people use one face cream everywhere, then wonder why their eyes and neck show age first. They aren't the same skin. Eyelid skin is the thinnest on your body. Neck skin has up to 40% less thickness than your face, fewer oil glands and lower collagen density. Bio-Active Ceramide NP is the constant across all three, going beyond the skin's surface to strengthen the barrier. What changes is what sits alongside it: Gransil Blur X-11 to blur fine lines on the face, a Tetrapeptide Complex to lift and firm the eye contour, Gatuline In-Tense MB and CO₂llageneer to support elasticity below the jawline.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow it feels:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eThree textures, deliberately. A rich velvety cream for the face, a lightweight silky cream for the eyes, and a solid glide-on stick for the neck and décolletage. All absorb quickly and layer under makeup and SPF without pilling.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhen to use:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eAM and PM. Eye cream first, then neck stick, then moisturiser across face, neck and chest. Follow with SPF in the morning.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-09-20T07:50:57+01:00","created_at":"2026-08-12T13:57:59+01:00","updated_at":"2026-0